<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Atalanta 4 (Inzaghi 15th and 31st minutes, Rotella 54, Sgro 62)</p>
<p>Piacenza 0. Halftime 2-0. Attendance: 16,000</p>
<p>Cagliari 2 (Muzzi 19, Pancaro 21 - penalty) Bologna 2</p>
<p>(Kolyvanov 13, Nervo 29). 2-2. 15,000</p>
<p>Inter 3 (Branca 13 and 46, Berti 43) Sampdoria 4 (Montella 7,</p>
<p>56 , Franceschetti 85, Mancini 88). 2-1. 45,000</p>
<p>Juventus 3 (Porrini 45, Del Piero 65 - penalty - and 74) Verona</p>
<p>2 (Maniero 25 and 44). 1-2. 15,000</p>
<p>Perugia 1 (Gautieri 79) Lazio 2 (Rambaudi 72, Signori 80 -</p>
<p>penalty). 0-0. 20,000</p>
<p>Reggiana 0 Milan 3 (Albertini 3,  70  and 78 - both penalties).</p>
<p>0-1. 20,000</p>
<p>Roma 1 (Aldair 78) Napoli 0. 0-0. 52,000</p>
<p>Udinese 2 (Amoroso 18 and 28) Fiorentina 0. 2-0. 15,000</p>
